{
"file": 1020,
"paths": [
"d008/d133/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "139c95df",
"en_raw": "Thanks for coming, Murase"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0f659619",
"en_raw": "Murase?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "3d5b8aae",
"en_raw": "...Where's Segawa?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "4d3ca93a",
"en_raw": "That guy is a traitor"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "12127777",
"en_raw": "Traitors"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "687ebf32",
"en_raw": "must receive their due punishment"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "45d835e4",
"en_raw": "...Though I'm not keen on it"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "5691f09f",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "de9e4b37",
"en_raw": "I should have told you this"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "296b9004",
"en_raw": "earlier, I guess..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "d6e25e0f",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "60a3dfc7",
"en_raw": "I think of you as a friend"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "31a0129e",
"en_raw": "so I've told you many things"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "1af2cdc4",
"en_raw": "and I plan to keep doing so"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "edc61caf",
"en_raw": "But this story"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "ac68e50a",
"en_raw": "isn't for just anyone to hear"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1b6b57de",
"en_raw": "Just telling it"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "eba7f840",
"en_raw": "is a very dangerous act"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "c48a0a7b",
"en_raw": "Wait a second"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "35149856",
"en_raw": "Kume, my story too..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "98602ca3",
"en_raw": "This universe has rules"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "cf41fb32",
"en_raw": "you know"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "afbbfa2d",
"en_raw": "For better or worse"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "88d2ce2d",
"en_raw": "so energy doesn't become lopsided"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "9b19f385",
"en_raw": "it manipulates events by fate"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "bd059abc",
"en_raw": "you could call it God's invisible hand"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "793a860c",
"en_raw": "...Karma"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "90629815",
"en_raw": "But summoning that truth"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "bd9cf437",
"en_raw": "takes a bit of"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "082e2c4b",
"en_raw": "technique"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ce2456a5",
"en_raw": "Aleister Crowley, you know"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "b0887d9b",
"en_raw": "that NM and KS are an item?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "caa4c736",
"en_raw": "is what he used"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "fc343177",
"en_raw": "Foolish scum"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "c618b4f5",
"en_raw": "call it magic"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c8123ff7",
"en_raw": "but really it's just bringing it"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "a7bd70f4",
"en_raw": "into this world according to"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "ffd44a14",
"en_raw": "proper rules, that's all"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "193db598",
"en_raw": "...True judgment, you see"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "7114c461",
"en_raw": "You don't seem like"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "8f6afe0c",
"en_raw": "your usual self, Kume"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "5813e80d",
"en_raw": "...Everything irritates me"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "788071c8",
"en_raw": "Then what is my"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "df29a606",
"en_raw": "usual self supposed to be!"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "d3c10fce",
"en_raw": "...N-nothing like that"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "d39c138d",
"en_raw": "I didn't mean that"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ff3deaea",
"en_raw": "I just thought, you know"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "c64b067b",
"en_raw": "some hard words"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "54f67fe6",
"en_raw": "Of course!"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6b1471d9",
"en_raw": "You just keep quiet"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "15396beb",
"en_raw": "and listen"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "4d64dab2",
"en_raw": "When you say pointless things,"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "b855c310",
"en_raw": "I lose the will to talk!"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "542d60d0",
"en_raw": "...Y-yeah"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "ce149ac6",
"en_raw": "They're all irritating"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "6b728642",
"en_raw": "Yuasa, Itsumi,"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "aa28743b",
"en_raw": "Okochi..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "cd951b62",
"en_raw": "They're truly worthless"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "7fceeb0d",
"en_raw": "Yamazaki, Nishi,"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "2ea7c2fc",
"en_raw": "Sanjo..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "eede7bfd",
"en_raw": "and then Shinta Segawa!"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "3d1894c7",
"en_raw": "Betrayal is the worst act!"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "b3099971",
"en_raw": "I... I, you see..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "92959214",
"en_raw": "I've put up with a lot anyway"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "d6e25e0f",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "19e76c9e",
"en_raw": "You understand, don't you?"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "42f6d6c8",
"en_raw": "I get it, I totally get it"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "58c4224c",
"en_raw": "...Kids these days"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "c3c51566",
"en_raw": "it starts with their parents"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "16ef44ba",
"en_raw": "It's really pitiful"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "7da887b7",
"en_raw": "Spoiled like elementary schoolers"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "565e69b8",
"en_raw": "from the start"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "344f5b08",
"en_raw": "Mount Fuji"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "49be40e8",
"en_raw": "will erupt eventually"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "74933cc8",
"en_raw": "and then it's over"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "e26759fb",
"en_raw": "If it comes to that"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "ceabdb04",
"en_raw": "crime is an everyday thing"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "c92e36d6",
"en_raw": "and before that, they can't do"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "09cc6fab",
"en_raw": "anything alone"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "b5dd2972",
"en_raw": "Either way"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "5fd2019c",
"en_raw": "none of them will be saved"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "7ced355d",
"en_raw": "...But only you and I will be saved"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "64f70082",
"en_raw": "You'll cooperate, right?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "7109388a",
"en_raw": "In offering the final sacrifice"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "b9d9c18c",
"en_raw": "...The final sacrifice?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "47451ffe",
"en_raw": "I carefully checked the horoscope"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "95291c25",
"en_raw": "and searched the roster for someone"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "ce2663d8",
"en_raw": "with the matching birth date"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "d98c9483",
"en_raw": "That's the sacrifice"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "2bfb89d9",
"en_raw": "...The name?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "849a8ad5",
"en_raw": "Class 2-3..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "6091b53a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "2d57f8e9",
"en_raw": "Stop it already, it's a bad joke"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "2718e094",
"en_raw": "...I can't blame you for thinking so"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "2efd8b54",
"en_raw": "This time, all the curses"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ee118015",
"en_raw": "were ruined by you"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "87dc45d9",
"en_raw": "But this time, I'll prove it"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "77cb48cb",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "d97bc442",
"en_raw": "You're my friend, right?"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "0cbfde97",
"en_raw": "You won't say"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "1a59879a",
"en_raw": "you deny everything now?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "9cb2d5b2",
"en_raw": "or something..."
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "a3d78b2c",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "5a96260e",
"en_raw": "But, what?"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "6938b6e7",
"en_raw": "N-no"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "2df4390a",
"en_raw": "I can't do it..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "5f4018de",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "9e0a26c1",
"en_raw": "People really are lonely, huh"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "2592d8f8",
"en_raw": "Well, I knew that"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "f50e447a",
"en_raw": "But Murase"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "da26cd97",
"en_raw": "listen"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "f459a428",
"en_raw": "You made me say this much"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "2bb49223",
"en_raw": "you don't think you can go home free, do you"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "2130dd77",
"en_raw": "...Right?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "cd6bdddf",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, free?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "c35b065d",
"en_raw": "You've always thought"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "0ce30336",
"en_raw": "I was a weak, cowardly fighter"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "db88d51c",
"en_raw": "haven't you?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "212997c2",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "6970b88d",
"en_raw": "that's a huge misunderstanding"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "3a6ceabd",
"en_raw": "I guess I have to show at least"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "7aebf873",
"en_raw": "one piece of proof"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "9aa6174e",
"en_raw": "You're underestimating me"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "3a6ceabd",
"en_raw": "I guess I have to show at least"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "7aebf873",
"en_raw": "one piece of proof"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "fdd724f4",
"en_raw": "At the crucial moment"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "c65a0f7e",
"en_raw": "you try to run"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "8c9bf748",
"en_raw": "...Didn't I say before?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "b0b1f92a",
"en_raw": "you'd better"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "87389bb0",
"en_raw": "that I should hold back"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "08ffe8e2",
"en_raw": "But Kume, you said"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "52e484f0",
"en_raw": "I could just listen quietly"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "0c9ee702",
"en_raw": "...So you stayed quiet,"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "6e591dc3",
"en_raw": "is that what you mean!"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "9cf9b20f",
"en_raw": "Murase..."
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "1f85b1db",
"en_raw": "You're cockier"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "9f4b984d",
"en_raw": "than I thought"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "221330b7",
"en_raw": "Do you act like that"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "7559ebb5",
"en_raw": "toward others too?"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "95b410ab",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "316f7840",
"en_raw": "Usually I only say things"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "f4b59703",
"en_raw": "the other person"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "4f025554",
"en_raw": "will take well"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "736060e7",
"en_raw": "That way"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "7c385b7a",
"en_raw": "I don't have to think much"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "7bb7567e",
"en_raw": "But today is different"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "dfe4a654",
"en_raw": "There was something"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "8473acd5",
"en_raw": "I had to say"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "928815fc",
"en_raw": "and that... that story..."
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "9440fe45",
"en_raw": "Kume"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "c6ccf310",
"en_raw": "didn't listen"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "c3d51fa6",
"en_raw": "Angolmois!"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "c35b065d",
"en_raw": "You've always thought"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "0ce30336",
"en_raw": "I was a weak, cowardly fighter"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "db88d51c",
"en_raw": "haven't you?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "212997c2",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "6970b88d",
"en_raw": "that's a huge misunderstanding"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "3a6ceabd",
"en_raw": "I guess I have to show at least"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "7aebf873",
"en_raw": "one piece of proof"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "9aa6174e",
"en_raw": "You're underestimating me"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "3a6ceabd",
"en_raw": "I guess I have to show at least"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "7aebf873",
"en_raw": "one piece of proof"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "5d0b33f3",
"en_raw": "Ah!!"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "fcea2bd6",
"en_raw": "Kume, what you're doing"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "91873dec",
"en_raw": "Isn't"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "c9ce15b5",
"en_raw": "the least bit real"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "7b7f44c9",
"en_raw": "nowadays"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "09c94316",
"en_raw": "Put that away quickly"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "cc1cabc3",
"en_raw": "I'll shout"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "6e4534cd",
"en_raw": "...What is that,"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "09b84cd3",
"en_raw": "why are you guys here?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "29f5b02d",
"en_raw": "...I won't tell anyone,"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "ca3d274d",
"en_raw": "I promise"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "4f4c22ce",
"en_raw": "So, Kume"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "128c4337",
"en_raw": "listen to my story"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "daca13d4",
"en_raw": "I understand"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "14b5eab2",
"en_raw": "most of the reason"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "e15bb4da",
"en_raw": "I didn't come here"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "0169832e",
"en_raw": "to make Kume"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "82870be0",
"en_raw": "the bad guy"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "1c4eb3bf",
"en_raw": "That feeling hasn't changed"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "d2744677",
"en_raw": "Do you think I can trust you"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "55891690",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "8e25bdbd",
"en_raw": "now?"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "5f714571",
"en_raw": "I never meant"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "1526c62c",
"en_raw": "to deceive you"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "540c460f",
"en_raw": "You can't answer that, can you"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "773e6d46",
"en_raw": "We just happened"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "df263549",
"en_raw": "to be passing by"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "0b36602a",
"en_raw": "and overheard a weird story"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "289ac2d2",
"en_raw": "...Karma and"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "b78345a5",
"en_raw": "the rules of the universe"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "8b7f0153",
"en_raw": "Sango, be quiet"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "52d4b2ec",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume,"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "8dc39270",
"en_raw": "that everything you do is a lie"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "e20e18ea",
"en_raw": "I don't think that"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "5218ee7c",
"en_raw": "at all"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "c88513aa",
"en_raw": "Honestly, I'm scared"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "3f669a69",
"en_raw": "What if what Kume did"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "38312954",
"en_raw": "becomes real..."
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "eb3ae179",
"en_raw": "...Do you really think so?"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "63d0e9cd",
"en_raw": "I do"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "3d9a8916",
"en_raw": "But even so, I don't think"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "87ab8cb9",
"en_raw": "doing such things is right"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "08d9754d",
"en_raw": "I'm not without frustration"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "92b61ce2",
"en_raw": "myself"
},
{
"n": 209,
"h": "1cffbe17",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and the others"
},
{
"n": 210,
"h": "1b15f6b6",
"en_raw": "irritate me"
},
{
"n": 211,
"h": "4639a00c",
"en_raw": "Same for me"
},
{
"n": 212,
"h": "52386929",
"en_raw": "...K-Kume, calm down"
},
{
"n": 213,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 214,
"h": "b65e79b4",
"en_raw": "...Are you serious, you guys"
},
{
"n": 215,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 216,
"h": "8e5722ef",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi the ugly,"
},
{
"n": 217,
"h": "c3c7038f",
"en_raw": "stop these guys"
},
{
"n": 218,
"h": "ca8155dc",
"en_raw": "out of pity"
},
{
"n": 219,
"h": "964fe859",
"en_raw": "You"
},
{
"n": 220,
"h": "103d22a2",
"en_raw": "can get stabbed, fine"
},
{
"n": 221,
"h": "be064f1c",
"en_raw": "So Kume really is the culprit..."
},
{
"n": 222,
"h": "ddfc5261",
"en_raw": "I suspected so from the start,"
},
{
"n": 223,
"h": "f01c665f",
"en_raw": "but I never thought"
},
{
"n": 224,
"h": "c7e3baf4",
"en_raw": "I was the target"
},
{
"n": 225,
"h": "f6ca5f79",
"en_raw": "Segawa"
},
{
"n": 226,
"h": "54d79846",
"en_raw": "told us everything"
},
{
"n": 227,
"h": "70d3168a",
"en_raw": "What a troublesome"
},
{
"n": 228,
"h": "ff787c83",
"en_raw": "curse maniac"
},
{
"n": 229,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 230,
"h": "46ff2b6a",
"en_raw": "But I learned something"
},
{
"n": 231,
"h": "df6de260",
"en_raw": "I wondered if you"
},
{
"n": 232,
"h": "d2c8f539",
"en_raw": "had such courage"
},
{
"n": 233,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 234,
"h": "2098dcb8",
"en_raw": "You really..."
},
{
"n": 235,
"h": "94968dcf",
"en_raw": "want to die...?"
},
{
"n": 236,
"h": "572ca2bd",
"en_raw": "Huh? I can't hear you"
},
{
"n": 237,
"h": "3224cc55",
"en_raw": "...Apologize to Kume"
},
{
"n": 238,
"h": "66c43a1e",
"en_raw": "Whoa, an unexpected turn"
},
{
"n": 239,
"h": "333dacff",
"en_raw": "Hey, isn't this weird?"
},
{
"n": 240,
"h": "4b750b19",
"en_raw": "Did I do something?"
},
{
"n": 241,
"h": "90b5419f",
"en_raw": "Who's the cause"
},
{
"n": 242,
"h": "ffcea881",
"en_raw": "I now understand well"
},
{
"n": 243,
"h": "f00aa640",
"en_raw": "I had no intention"
},
{
"n": 244,
"h": "9b5f5897",
"en_raw": "of fighting at all, but..."
},
{
"n": 245,
"h": "189e842e",
"en_raw": "Do you want to?"
},
{
"n": 246,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 247,
"h": "e4dc88f2",
"en_raw": "...Murase, it's okay"
},
{
"n": 248,
"h": "9a00d8a5",
"en_raw": "I'll handle this guy"
},
{
"n": 249,
"h": "8e97e0fd",
"en_raw": "I was going to anyway"
},
{
"n": 250,
"h": "e0f8ac4e",
"en_raw": "No hangers-on today"
},
{
"n": 251,
"h": "ba05ff20",
"en_raw": "perfect timing"
},
{
"n": 252,
"h": "f5cca779",
"en_raw": "Kume, I'm rooting for you"
},
{
"n": 253,
"h": "017ad828",
"en_raw": "This idiot, short as he is,"
},
{
"n": 254,
"h": "8ea33dea",
"en_raw": "is fast on his feet"
},
{
"n": 255,
"h": "9c69a594",
"en_raw": "so don't let him escape"
},
{
"n": 256,
"h": "4782945f",
"en_raw": "Shut up, ugly!"
},
{
"n": 257,
"h": "bb1c47f5",
"en_raw": "You guys are the worst"
},
{
"n": 258,
"h": "12f37d69",
"en_raw": "Gloomy, nasty..."
},
{
"n": 259,
"h": "3bbc41c3",
"en_raw": "I'm starting to pity you"
},
{
"n": 260,
"h": "355859b3",
"en_raw": "...Heh,"
},
{
"n": 261,
"h": "44909886",
"en_raw": "but the pitiful one now"
},
{
"n": 262,
"h": "58831429",
"en_raw": "is you, Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 263,
"h": "9d520e20",
"en_raw": "Today, there's no"
},
{
"n": 264,
"h": "8e5ba55c",
"en_raw": "yes-man, no"
},
{
"n": 265,
"h": "328142a8",
"en_raw": "reliable big guy"
},
{
"n": 266,
"h": "e72d49c8",
"en_raw": "...Kume, did you even have"
},
{
"n": 267,
"h": "e748d465",
"en_raw": "the feeling to call someone pitiful?"
},
{
"n": 268,
"h": "d7169203",
"en_raw": "Strange, whatever you say today"
},
{
"n": 269,
"h": "2a984d02",
"en_raw": "I'm not frustrated"
},
{
"n": 270,
"h": "eb81e89f",
"en_raw": "...Y-you're doing it?"
},
{
"n": 271,
"h": "e4e14aa0",
"en_raw": "It's a crime"
},
{
"n": 272,
"h": "de11bc52",
"en_raw": "Even having a knife like that"
},
{
"n": 273,
"h": "3fc6f8c5",
"en_raw": "is..."
},
{
"n": 274,
"h": "e7638fd2",
"en_raw": "Say what you like!"
},
{
"n": 275,
"h": "4229e79d",
"en_raw": "Ah"
},
{
"n": 276,
"h": "9960bd0f",
"en_raw": "Super skunk"
},
{
"n": 277,
"h": "513c9831",
"en_raw": "amazing speed!"
},
{
"n": 278,
"h": "8cdc4ed4",
"en_raw": "The worst!! So uncool!!"
},
{
"n": 279,
"h": "4db0672c",
"en_raw": "Never come to school again!!"
},
{
"n": 280,
"h": "e05d1a92",
"en_raw": "Murase..."
},
{
"n": 281,
"h": "59eae8dc",
"en_raw": "....."
},
{
"n": 282,
"h": "992ceb2c",
"en_raw": "...Murase, I'm going home"
},
{
"n": 283,
"h": "df72d7f3",
"en_raw": "Sorry to ask"
},
{
"n": 284,
"h": "6a980eca",
"en_raw": "Apologize to Segawa for me"
},
{
"n": 285,
"h": "c98349f5",
"en_raw": "...Okay,"
},
{
"n": 286,
"h": "5a02be2f",
"en_raw": "I'll call him"
},
{
"n": 287,
"h": "e9b53a73",
"en_raw": "Then"
},
{
"n": 288,
"h": "1717d26c",
"en_raw": "...See you"
},
{
"n": 289,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 290,
"h": "ce6dfb69",
"en_raw": "...Good night, Kume"
},
{
"n": 291,
"h": "09b3e2f2",
"en_raw": "There, that attitude!"
},
{
"n": 292,
"h": "875b956b",
"en_raw": "You too make me"
},
{
"n": 293,
"h": "dc70b932",
"en_raw": "endure even more..."
},
{
"n": 294,
"h": "93ebfbca",
"en_raw": "Like those guys, you too"
},
{
"n": 295,
"h": "647eba5c",
"en_raw": "can't understand my feelings?"
},
{
"n": 296,
"h": "9d79722e",
"en_raw": "You come this far and go home?"
},
{
"n": 297,
"h": "8a031c3a",
"en_raw": "Sure enough"
},
{
"n": 298,
"h": "e25491a3",
"en_raw": "...That's just like you, maybe"
},
{
"n": 299,
"h": "eeb407a0",
"en_raw": "Really, I'm disappointed..."
},
{
"n": 300,
"h": "9ed8cfe6",
"en_raw": "Seems I didn't even need to"
},
{
"n": 301,
"h": "f4261565",
"en_raw": "lay a hand on you"
},
{
"n": 302,
"h": "ce0dcd31",
"en_raw": "...Coward"
}
]
}